### REGISTER AUTHOR
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname":"author1",
    "lastname":"",
    "email":"author1@mail.cc",
    "password":"author1",
    "role":"AUTHOR",
    "profileImageUrl":""
}

### CREATE NEW ARTICLE
POST http://localhost:5000/author-api/article
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "author":"69b4b23751b1cac7c39d2e2e",
    "title":"Article1 on AI",
    "category":"AI",
    "content":"test article on AI"
    
}

### AUTHOR LOGIN
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email":"author1@mail.cc",
    "password":"author1"
}

### AUTHOR LOGOUT
GET http://localhost:5000/auth/logout

### READ OWN ARTICLES
GET http://localhost:5000/author-api/articles

### UPDATE ARTICLES BY AUTHOR
PUT http://localhost:5000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "articleId":"69b4b23751b1cac7c39d2e2e",
    "title":"Article-1 by on Author 1",
    "category":"AI",
    "content":"test article on AI"

}

### DELETE/RESTORE ARTICLE BY ARTICLE ID (SOFT DELETE)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
     "articleId":"",
     "isArticleActive":true
}


